### Demo 1 - first AI endpoint
GET http://localhost:8080/chat?message=Explain dependency injection in 3 lines

### Demo 1 - streaming
GET http://localhost:8080/chat/stream?message=Write a haiku about Java

### Demo 1 - per-request system prompt
GET http://localhost:8080/explain?topic=recursion&level=a 10 year old

### Demo 2 - structured output
GET http://localhost:8080/study-plan?subject=Data Structures&days=5

### Demo 3 - memory + tools (turn 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/assistant?user=21BCE1234&message=My reg no is 21BCE1234. Which AI Lab slots are free?

### Demo 3 - memory + tools (turn 2: "the 2 PM one" only works because of memory)
GET http://localhost:8080/assistant?user=21BCE1234&message=Book the 2 PM one for me

### Demo 3 - a different user has no memory of the above
GET http://localhost:8080/assistant?user=22BIT0042&message=What did I just book?

