### Demo 4 - another grounded question
GET http://localhost:8080/ask?question=How much does re-evaluation cost and is it refunded?

### Prompting (short talk, no exercise) - vague
GET http://localhost:8080/chat?message=Write about Java streams.

### Prompting (short talk, no exercise) - clear
GET http://localhost:8080/chat?message=You are helping second-year students prepare for a viva. Explain Java streams in 5 short bullet points, with one 3-line code example. If you are not sure about something, say so.

### Bonus (not in the live session) - a small agent: one goal, the model plans the tool calls itself
GET http://localhost:8080/assistant?user=21BCE1234&message=Find me a free slot in the Cloud Lab after lunch and book it. My reg no is 21BCE1234.

### Bonus - same goal on the agent instance (qwen2.5:7b, port 8081, see application-agent.yml)
